<title>COTE D'IVOIRE: Abidjan market holidays.</title>
<headline>Abidjan market holidays.</headline>
<dateline>ABIDJAN 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ivory coast bond and stock markets will be closed Friday April 18 for a holiday.</p>
<p>Normal trading resumes on Tuesday April 22.</p>
</text>
